OL,3,ASaudi Arabia vows to respond after
OL,4,AHouthis attack cities and energy
OL,5,Afacilities
OL,6,
OL,7,FYemen's Iran-backed Houthi movement has
OL,8,Fattacked energy facilities and other
OL,9,Fcivilian infrastructure in Saudi Arabia
OL,10,Fwith dozens of drones and missiles,
OL,11,Finjuring 73 people, Saudi authorities
OL,12,Fsay.
OL,14,FTuesday's attacks hit four
OL,15,Fsouth-western cities, causing fires at
OL,16,Foil facilities and installations that
OL,17,Fled to a temporary halt in operations,
OL,18,Faccording to Saudi Arabia's military
OL,19,Fand energy ministry.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
