OL,3,ASaudi Arabia vows to respond after
OL,4,AHouthis attack cities and energy
OL,5,Afacilities
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Saudi-led coalition in Yemen said
OL,8,Fthat its forces would respond to the
OL,9,F"dangerous escalation".
OL,11,FThe Houthis said the attacks were
OL,12,Fretaliation for dozens of recent Saudi
OL,13,Fstrikes on areas of north-western Yemen
OL,14,Fthat they control.
